{"id":10144,"name":"mimikyu-totem-disguised","speciesId":778,"dex":778,"form":"other","generation":7,"types":["ghost","fairy"],"stats":{"hp":55,"attack":90,"defense":80,"special-attack":50,"special-defense":105,"speed":96},"abilities":[{"name":"disguise","hidden":false}],"height":4,"weight":28,"baseExp":167,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10144.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/10144.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10144.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10144.ogg","genus":"Disguise Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"sun","text":"Its actual appearance is unknown. A scholar who saw what was under its rag was overwhelmed by terror and died from the shock."},{"version":"moon","text":"A lonely Pokémon, it conceals its terrifying appearance beneath an old rag so it can get closer to people and other Pokémon."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although it’s a quiet, lonely Pokémon, if you try to look at what’s under its rag, it will become agitated and resist violently."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"A gust of wind revealed what hides under this Pokémon’s rag to a passing Trainer, who went home and died painfully that very night."},{"version":"sword","text":"It wears a rag fashioned into a Pikachu costume in an effort to look less scary. Unfortunately, the costume only makes it creepier."},{"version":"shield","text":"There was a scientist who peeked under Mimikyu’s old rag in the name of research. The scientist died of a mysterious disease."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["indeterminate"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"mimikyu","speciesId":778,"evolvesTo":[]},"varieties":[{"id":778,"name":"mimikyu-disguised","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprite